your service, you are no longer necessary. I would&nbsp;
say probably in the neighborhood of five, 600.&nbsp;

00:51:43.187 --> 00:51:48.720
Tim Ferriss: That's a solid — I&nbsp;
mean that's solid canon. After,&nbsp;&nbsp;

